395 0) (effects (font (size 1.3335 1.3335))) (uuid "cc197406-7723-5512-aa24-679b1c8975c1"))(text "8  GUIA DE IMPLEMENTAÇÃO E REGRAS CRÍTICAS DO MVP REV. A (91 COMPONENTES)" (at 315.722 364.87735 0) (effects (font (size 2.0955 2.0955)) (justify left)) (uuid "4e8e1c7c-f79b-5003-afb4-1e43ac7a43f9"))(text "FLUXO END-TO-END (NOMES IGUAIS CONECTAM NA PRANCHA):" (at 315.722 371.64137 0) (effects (font (size 1.5621 1.5621)) (justify left)) (uuid "9ca4db77-942e-5a41-b32b-72bf18a0fde3"))(text "  [1] Bancada 12V (I_limit 250-300 mA) -> D1 (1N4007) -> +RAW -> U5 (CW7805) -> J5 -> +5VA | R22/23 -> VREF_OP (~5,5V) | R27/28 -> ADC_BIAS (~2,4V)" (at 315.722 377.77166 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "303d5baa-076b-5715-9aed-2917f3687558"))(text "  [2->3->4] J2 (P10 IN) -> C1 -> U1A (Buffer) -> U3A/U3B -> C2/C16 -> AINA_P/N -> U2 (CS4272) -> AOUTA_P/N -> C10/C11 -> U1B -> R4/C4/R5/C6 -> C5/R6 -> J3 (P10 OUT)" (at 315.722 383.35966 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "254541d1-3285-5f81-b60a-3465145bd07c"))(text "  [5<->3/6] H_STM32 (USB propria) <-> U2 (SAI4/I2C/PD10 direto c/ R13=10k) | UART direta 115200: PD8-[R_UTX 1k]->GPIO16 e GPIO17-[R_URX 1k]->PD9 | SW1..4/D2..5" (at 315.722 388.94766 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "2a389c5d-fcd2-5708-81d6-54885a078685"))(text "CORTES / SUBSTITUICOES DO MVP:" (at 315.722 394.50137 0) (effects (font (size 1.5621 1.5621)) (justify left)) (uuid "3b0d354d-1135-5856-92aa-ec82af436c19"))(text "  - Removidos: Folha 9 (25), Folha 10 (42), Q11..Q14 (4), K1/D16 (2), U6+passivos (7), J1/F1/J4/TP* (14). Adicionados: R_UTX/R_URX (2x 1k). MANTIDOS: C35/C36 (100 pF RF)!" (at 315.722 400.63166 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "30586ef7-06e9-532a-96aa-54851ec58237"))(text "  - Diodos: todos 6x 1N4007 (D1, D8, D6, D7, D13, D14). Capacitores: APENAS ceramicos (<=1 µF) e eletroliticos (>=10 µF)." (at 315.722 406.21966 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "f5ee14d8-cf7d-5859-804a-9d7443735bbc"))(text "POLARIDADE OBRIGATORIA DOS 12 ELETROLITICOS (+ / -):" (at 315.722 411.77337 0) (effects (font (size 1.5621 1.5621)) (justify left)) (uuid "ae0f3936-244c-550e-b406-f9cdcc095f8c"))(text "  - C2, C16 (10 µF): (+) lado R18/R20 (~5,5V), (-) lado AINA_P/N (~2,4V) | C10, C11 (10 µF): (+) lado R1/R7 (~5,5V), (-) lado CS4272 AOUTA (~2,4V)" (at 315.722 417.90366 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "c4ee2d12-ae98-5a41-802e-00ced938bfd8"))(text "  - C5 (10 µF): (+) em LP2, (-) em OUT_PRE | C12 (47 µF): (+) pino 22 FILT+ | C33/C30/C32 (+ em +RAW) | C37 (+ em +5V_CW) | C38 (+ em VREF_OP) | C40 (+ em ADC_BIAS)" (at 315.722 423.49166 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "57b821d9-f263-5bf6-a1bb-ddcf9458d821"))(text "  - ATENCAO C14 (1 µF em VCOM pino 15): usar CERAMICO (nao eletrolitico) para nao vazar corrente em VCOM (~25 kΩ)." (at 315.722 429.07966 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "46940ef7-8e8e-5f15-b907-8b968421faa5"))(text "PROTOCOLO DE BANCADA & FIRMWARE PENDENTE:" (at 315.722 434.63337 0) (effects (font (size 1.5621 1.5621)) (justify left)) (uuid "33fbc861-389f-505c-89ed-d8c002eb8f01"))(text "  1) Ligar sempre na ordem: J5 ABERTO testar 5,0V em CW -> fechar J5 -> ligar 12V ANTES da USB STM32 (evita PD10=3V3 com VA=0V) -> ligar amp por ultimo." (at 315.722 440.76366 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "5f327530-1a13-5cb9-9a73-61c386a12bec"))(text "  2) Firmware STM32 atual tem HAL_SAI_MODULE_ENABLED comentado e dMAIN_AUDIO_TRANSPORT_READY=0U: implementar SAI4+DMA e fechar PC2_C/PC3_C (SYSCFG) antes do audio." (at 315.722 446.35166 0) (effects (font (size 1.4478 1.4478)) (justify left)) (uuid "5a304fb4-9d66-5be0-9e50-6ce187582947"))(symbol (lib_id "mvpA:PSU_12V") (at 71.12 63.5 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom no) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "b174f15d-78d7-56e1-9074-66b947b85ae2") (pro